# SAUND v3.4 example — Raw Bassline Techno (128 BPM)
# Bass riff = track identity. Instant attack, no intro silence.

[GLOBAL: RAW BASSLINE TECHNO; 128 BPM; F MINOR;
BASS RIFF = TRACK IDENTITY; KICK > BASS RIFF > PERCUSSION > FX > VOCAL;
RAW/PROVOCATIVE/MECHANICAL/FUNKY/UNSTOPPABLE;
CONTINUOUS_ENERGY; NO_BREAKDOWNS; NO_HALF_TIME; NO_DEAD_AIR;
VOCAL = RHYTHMIC HUMAN ACCENT, NEVER ROBOTIC;
INSTANT BASS ENTRY FROM 0:00; NO FADE-IN.]
[ARC: I G S K P R F O]
[DUR-PLAN: TOTAL=2:30; I=7,G=14,S=14,K=54,R=14,F=27,O=20]
