### COMPILED PROJECTION (Suno fields) ###

STYLE (794/800):
raw bassline techno, 128 BPM F minor, instant bass entry from 0:00, no fade-in, massive multi-layered bass wall: deep mono sub foundation, distorted talking-bass riff with vowel-formant sweeps, aggressive buzzing high-harmonics, relentless industrial kick, extreme sidechain pump creating breathing effect, syncopated bass stabs, gritty bitcrushed textures, metallic percussion, hypnotic mechanical groove, crushing club pressure, vocal chops as rhythmic hits only, no melody, no ambient intro, no breakdowns, wide stereo highs, tight mono low end, dirty but clear master, constant evolving timbre, heavy saturation, unstoppable energy, no standard bass plucks, pure rhythmic pressure, male raw shout vocal as percussion, pristine digital mastering, no high-cut.

LYRICS:
Zone B as above (markers + vocal text only, EN).
